# Read before change

Before changing this repo, read `docs/READ-BEFORE-CHANGE.md` (same process as `docs/READ-BEFORE-CHANGE.pdf`).

- That file is the product process. Follow it.
- If it does not say something, it is unknown: do not invent a rule, and say so.
- Do not put mock or UI copy that contradicts it (same-level same-department observers, assistant yearly, associate/full every 2 years, one course signup, observer pool on observee signup).
- Mock data is allowed only where no API exists, and it must be visibly labeled **Mock data**.
